  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://teamdiopside.nl/assets/separatedleaves/title.png\" alt=\"分離樹葉標題\"></p>\n<h3>Separated Leaves 是一款伺服器端資料驅動的模組，正如你所猜到的那樣，它會將樹葉分離。</h3>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252farchitectury-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/architectury-api_vector.svg\" alt=\"Architectury API\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/fabric-api_vector.svg\" alt=\"Fabric API\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/forge_vector.svg\" alt=\"Forge\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p>此模組讓樹葉只會依附在同種原木上。也就是說，例如當你砍倒與白樺樹相鄰的橡木樹時，即使橡樹葉原本與白樺樹相連，它們也會全部消失。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://teamdiopside.nl/assets/separatedleaves/showcase.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>這在裝飾樹木農場時也非常實用，因為你可以在建築中使用任何原木類型，而不必擔心樹葉會黏附在你的牆壁上。</p>\n<h3>本模組採用資料驅動設計！</h3>\n<p>這表示你可以透過資料包自行為任何模組新增相容性。<br>\n想學習如何操作嗎？請查看 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.teamdiopside.nl%252fseparated-leaves%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">文件</a>。</p>\n<h3>內建相容以下模組：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Atmospheric</li>\n<li>Autumnity</li>\n<li>Biomes o' Plenty</li>\n<li>Ecologics</li>\n<li>Environmental</li>\n<li>Hex Casting</li>\n<li>Malum</li>\n<li>Oh The Biomes You'll Go</li>\n<li>Premium Wood</li>\n<li>Quark</li>\n<li>Reqions Unexplored</li>\n<li>The Twilight Forest</li>\n<li>Upgrade Aquatic</li>\n<li>Windswept</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fteamdiopside.nl%252fdiscord%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://teamdiopside.nl/assets/diopside/Serverbanner.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>",
